---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SampleReport from '../../components/SampleReport.astro';
import { EXAMPLE_ANIMALS, EXAMPLE_BEFORE_CORRECTION as before, EXAMPLE_REPORT as after } from '../../data/sciground-example';
import '../../styles/sciground.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="A result with its evidence — SciGround sample report" description="Explore an illustrative two-group report, its synthetic source data, and the correction behind the result.">
<div class="sg-home sg-sample-page"><div class="sg-container"><a class="sg-text-link" href="/#report">← Back to SciGround</a><div class="sg-section-head"><p class="sg-kicker">Sample report / Synthetic data</p><h1>A result with its evidence.</h1><p class="sg-lead">Explore the corrected body-weight comparison shown on the homepage. This is a worked illustration, not a product-issued verification record or a real animal study.</p></div><SampleReport full />
<section class="sg-sample-revision"><h2>What changed?</h2><p>M17 was assigned to Treatment in the earlier analysis input. The supplied source records place it in Control. The correction changes its group, while retaining its 26.2 g measurement and all 20 animals.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><caption>Comparison before and after the source-based correction</caption><thead><tr><th>Result</th><th>Earlier input</th><th>Corrected input</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Control / Treatment n</th><td>{before.control.n} / {before.treatment.n}</td><td>{after.control.n} / {after.treatment.n}</td></tr><tr><th>Mean difference (g)</th><td>{before.meanDifference.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{after.meanDifference.toFixed(2)}</td></tr><tr><th>95% CI (g)</th><td>{before.confidenceInterval.low.toFixed(2)} to {before.confidenceInterval.high.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{after.confidenceInterval.low.toFixed(2)} to {after.confidenceInterval.high.toFixed(2)}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Both versions remain distinguishable. A prior result is not automatically evidence for corrected data. This example does not establish that the comparison was specified before data collection.</p></section>
<details class="sg-source-records"><summary>Inspect all 20 source rows <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><caption>Synthetic source data; Day14, one measurement per animal</caption><thead><tr><th>Animal</th><th>Source group</th><th>Weight (g)</th><th>Earlier input group</th></tr></thead><tbody>{EXAMPLE_ANIMALS.map(a=><tr><th scope="row">{a.id}</th><td>{a.group}</td><td>{a.weight.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{a.beforeGroup}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></details><div class="sg-actions sg-sample-actions"><a class="sg-button" href="/docs/sciground-connect/">Start with your analysis <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="sg-text-link" href="/examples/group-comparison.csv" download>Download synthetic data <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div></div>
</BaseLayout>
